<title>USA: TABLE - Frankfort First FY 1997 results.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Frankfort First FY 1997 results.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFORT, Ky. 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.12   profit	 $0.52</p>
<p> Net loss		     368   profit	 1,660</p>
